msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "And she was his."
msgstr "그리고 그녀는 그의 것이 되었다."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Now and forever, the imprint that the captain had left on her, would never go away."
msgstr "이제부터 영원히, 선장이 그녀에게 남긴 흔적은 결코 사라지지 않을 것이다."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "For the rest of her life, he would be the man against whom all others were measured, and against whom all others fell short."
