msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah wondered if perhaps Nick would regain some of his spirits, now that he was free, but he seemed equally broken."
msgstr "사라는 닉이 이제 자유를 얻었으니 기운을 조금이라도 되찾지 않을까 생각했지만, 그는 여전히 완전히 무너져 있는 것처럼 보였다."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whatever the captain had given back to him wasn't nearly as much as he had taken from him."
msgstr "선장이 그에게 돌려준 것이 그가 빼앗아 간 것에 비하면 아무것도 아니었다."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "For a man like Nick, to have suffered such a humiliating defeat at the hands of the captain...she wasn't sure he'd soon get over it."
msgstr "니크 같은 남자가 선장의 손에 그런 굴욕적인 패배를 겪었다니... 그가 곧 이 상처에서 벗어날 수 있을지 그녀는 확신하지 못했다."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Belmont paid him his due and with that send him off."
msgstr "벨몬트 선장은 그에게 마땅히 주어야 할 것을 지불하고는 그를 보내주었다."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Nick didn't say much else, not even bothering to say goodbye to her. Then again, Sarah doubted there was much good will left between the two of them."
